     3980      then do:
     3981         run send-command-esys in p-esys-cmd-proc-handle
     3982             (input p-esys-cmd-code
     3983             ,input p-esys-id-list
     3984             ,input p-user-id
     3985             ,output v-dmp-ord-int64
     3986             ) no-error.
